    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "what kind of help? i feel like i've talked to doctors and people who try to fix me, but they just want me to feel \"better\" so i can go back to being the person everyone expects me to be. but there's nothing to fix. there's just nothing there. i just want the noise of it to stop. i want it to just be still.",
